ecomes-slides-and-narration.1.1", "status": "ready", "text": "Inside the session, the builder parses the new Markdown. Headings become slides, fenced blocks become visuals, and plain paragraphs become narration. Then each new paragraph is sent off to be voiced, and subscribers hear which slides changed. Problems, like a cue pointing at a missing line, go back to the agent in the reply.", "cues": [{"at": 20, "end": 55, "label": "the builder parses the new Markdown", "target": "L58", "text": "", "kind": "lines", "side": "new", "l0": 58, "l1": 58, "t": 1.375}, {"at": 155, "end": 198, "label": "each new paragraph is sent off to be voiced", "target": "L61-62", "text": "", "kind": "lines", "side": "new", "l0": 61, "l1": 62, "t": 9.938}, {"at": 204, "end": 241, "label": "subscribers hear which slides changed", "target": "L63", "text": "", "kind": "lines", "side": "new", "l0": 63, "l1": 63, "t": 12.575}, {"at": 313, "end": 325, "label": "in the reply", "target": "L64", "text": "", "kind": "lines", "side": "new", "l0": 64, "l1": 64, "t": 19.55}], "notes": [], "code": [], "audio": "audio/fda3cd69654c0db2ad6bcb16.mp3", "duration": 20.75, "words": [{"s": 0.325, "e": 0.713, "c0": 0, "c1": 6}, {"s": 0.713, "e": 0.8, "c0": 7, "c1": 10}, {"s": 0.8, "e": 1.3, "c0": 11, "c1": 18}, {"s": 1.375, "e": 1.475, "c0": 20, "c1": 23}, {"s": 1.475, "e": 1.85, "c0": 24, "c1": 31}, {"s": 1.85, "e": 2.325, "c0": 32, "c1": 38}, {"s": 2.325, "e": 2.425, "c0": 39, "c1": 42}, {"s": 2.425, "e": 2.6, "c0": 43, "c1": 46}, {"s": 2.6, "e": 3.525, "c0": 47, "c1": 55}, {"s": 3.663, "e": 4.125, "c0": 57, "c1": 65}, {"s": 4.125, "e": 4.525, "c0": 66, "c1": 72}, {"s": 4.525, "e": 5.2, "c0": 73, "c1": 79}, {"s": 5.312, "e": 5.675, "c0": 81, "c1": 87}, {"s": 5.675, "e": 6.075, "c0": 88, "c1": 94}, {"s": 6.075, "e": 6.425, "c0": 95, "c1": 101}, {"s": 6.425, "e": 6.95, "c0": 102, "c1": 109}, {"s": 7.0, "e": 7.138, "c0": 111, "c1": 114}, {"s": 7.138, "e": 7.475, "c0": 115, "c1": 120}, {"s": 7.475, "e": 8.1, "c0": 1